# ТЕМЩИК — Guidelines for Cursor

## Primary Rule: Money = Health (HP)
- `player.money` is the only vitality metric.
- No separate HP pool. Losing money means taking damage.
- `money <= 0` triggers Game Over (Bankruptcy).

## Primary Rule: Zero Combat System
- No weapon attacks, no swords/guns combat system, no enemy AI loops.
- Everything is resolved via dialogue choices and RNG d20 dice checks.

## Tech Stack
- Vanilla ES6 JavaScript (Native browser modules with `.js` extensions in imports).
- HTML5 Canvas for background ambience & pixel particle effects.
- Semantic HTML + CSS for UI overlay on `#ui-overlay`.
- Zero build tools required.

## Key Modules
- `src/core/GameStateManager.js`: Handles states (`HUB`, `EXPLORATION`, `DIALOGUE`, `GAME_OVER`).
- `src/core/EventBus.js`: Global events (`STATE_CHANGED`, `MONEY_CHANGED`, `PLAYER_DAMAGED`, `PLAYER_REWARDED`, `GAME_OVER`).
- `src/entities/Player.js`: Holds `money`, `stats: { authority, connections, cunning }`, `rollCheck()`.
- `src/vfx/PixelFX.js`: Integer-snapped pixel particles, screen shake, hit flash, `createFx(type, x, y, options)`.
- `src/dialogue/DialogueManager.js`: Manages story events, choices, dice rolls, rewards/losses.
- `src/ui/UIManager.js`: Renders panels for each state and the persistent top HUD.
